Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: btrfs-care
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Automated scrub and balance maintenance for Btrfs
 btrfs_care scans every mounted Btrfs filesystem, ensures regularly
 scheduled scrubs, resumes aborted runs, and executes incremental
 balances. It can log kernel warnings, expose a test mode with bundled
 fixtures, and ships systemd units for unattended maintenance.
